			"SHA": "445b2fd58ce77390a224dc2874fbcf33846e4d96"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-28T23:06:07Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				41,
				1
			],
			"Message": "fix(Worker): Remove obsolete precache paths from Service Worker\n\nThe `CORE_PRECACHE` array contained pre-bundle paths (`/Worker/Policy.js`, `/Worker/Register.js`, `/Worker/CSS/Load.js`) that no longer exist under Vite/Astro. These scripts are now inlined into a single hashed `_astro/WorkerBundleImports.astro_*.js` chunk, making the standalone `/Worker/*.js` URLs invalid.\n\nKeeping these paths in `cache.addAll(...)` caused every service worker install to emit `[Worker] Core Precaching failed: TypeError: Failed to fetch` and polluted Mountain.log with three SPA-fallback DEBUG triplets per boot.\n\nReplaced the array with an empty readonly array and added comments explaining that the runtime fetch handler caches assets on demand instead.",
			"SHA": "47516e2676a9f37e177da3d05b8babe8c386692e"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Auto",
			"Date": "2026-04-28T02:43:46Z",
